- `FROM node:24-alpine` selects the Node.js base image.
- `WORKDIR /app` sets the working directory inside the container.
- `COPY` transfers the application files into the image.
- `EXPOSE 3000` documents the application's listening port.
- `CMD` starts the Node.js application when the container runs.

