```

We checked the complete file and corrected the indentation of the two tags.

The final tags section was:

```yaml
          tags: |
            kelyunice1419/container-deployment-practice:1.0
            kelyunice1419/container-deployment-practice:${{ github.sha }}
```

## 10.2 Inspect the changes

```bash
